        "original_id": "ac3a0eed-e1a3-5eeb-b73a-da22ba33b05e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daragh O'Malley, Bob Hoskins, Helen Mirren, Sean Bean, Assumpta Serna\n- Works: The Long Good Friday, Withnail and I, Tales of The Unexpected, Waking the Dead, Wire in the Blood, Silent Witness, Vera, Longitude, Cleopatra, The Magnificent Seven, Vendetta, Camelot, Shaughnessy, Sharpe's Rifles\n- Organizations: ITV, ABC, CBS\n\nFacts:\n- Daragh O'Malley first appeared in roles in the films The Long Good Friday and Withnail and I.\n- The Long Good Friday is a British gangster film starring Bob Hoskins and Helen Mirren.\n- In 1993, ITV showed Sharpe's Rifles, and the adaptation starred Sean Bean, Daragh O'Malley, and Assumpta Serna.\n- Daragh O'Malley had leading guest roles in the UK television series Tales of The Unexpected, Waking the Dead, Wire in the Blood, Silent Witness, and Vera.\n- Daragh O'Malley had roles in Longitude, Cleopatra for ABC, The Magnificent Seven for CBS, and the US TV films Vendetta, Camelot, and Shaughnessy.",
